{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'nl -ba collab/exception-track/1794320926000-architect-dsg-condition-r4-coupling.gemini-4-argon-high.findings.md; nl -ba collab/exception-track/1794332020000-architect-value-path-refusal-shape.prompt.md; wc -l collab/exception-track/1794332020000-architect-value-path-refusal-shape.codex-astra.stdout.log'","aggregated_output":"     1\t## Ruling: **(B) Load-bearing** (as a provenance distinction between retained protocol conditions and guest-thrown condition-shaped data; **defective in `98519957`** because `compile-program` leaves stale `:tail? true` marks on the operand of `strip-top-outcome`, causing `:semantic` to tail-skip the top-level stripper, and because literal `:dsg__condition true` is guest-forgeable under R5)\n     2\t\n     3\t---\n     4\t\n     5\t### 1. Complete Inventory of `:dsg__condition` on `exception-r3-impl` (`98519957`)\n     6\t\n     7\t`git grep -n 'dsg__condition' 98519957` finds **11 lines across 9 sites**, all in [`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc) (`0` occurrences on `master` @ `8cd9fc92`, `0` occurrences in `test/`):\n     8\t\n     9\t#### A. 7 Writer Sites (all in [`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc) at `98519957`)\n    10\t\n    11\t1. **[`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1543-1544`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1543-L1544)** — [`condition->outcome`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1530-L1549) inside [`compile-guest-call`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1517-L1658) (consequent branch when `reason` is one of `:yang.call/{thrown, not-callable, invalid-invocation, unsupported-binding}`):\n    12\t   ```clojure\n    13\t   (outcome-node error-tag\n    14\t                 (u/app (u/v 'dsg__assoc) (u/v condition) (u/lit :dsg__condition) (u/lit true)))\n    15\t   ```\n    16\t2. **[`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1546-1548`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1546-L1548)** — [`condition->outcome`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1530-L1549) inside [`compile-guest-call`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1517-L1658) (alternate branch when `condition` has no recognized `:yang.call/reason`):\n    17\t   ```clojure\n    18\t   (outcome-node error-tag\n    19\t                 (u/app (u/v 'dsg__assoc)\n    20\t                        (u/app (u/v 'yang.call/thrown) (u/v condition))\n    21\t                        (u/lit :dsg__condition) (u/lit true)))\n    22\t   ```\n    23\t3. **[`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1560-1567`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1560-L1567)** — `refused` inside [`compile-guest-call`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1517-L1658) (when `(dsg__admitted? callee)` is false):\n    24\t   stamps `(u/lit :dsg__condition) (u/lit true)` onto `(yang.call/condition :yang.call/not-callable {:yang.call/callee callee})`.\n    25\t4. **[`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1580-1586`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1580-L1586)** — `activation` inside [`compile-guest-call`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1517-L1658) (when `escape` fails `:clj/escape-token` check):\n    26\t   stamps `(u/lit :dsg__condition) (u/lit true)` onto `(yang.call/condition :yang.call/invalid-invocation {:yang.call/reason :missing-raise-exit})`.\n    27\t5. **[`src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:1630-1636`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1630-L1636)** — `value-call` inside [`compile-guest-call`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc#L1517-L1658) (when `dsg__raise_escape` fails `:clj/escape-token` check):\n    28\t   stamps `(u/